1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Where am I?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Why am I not dead?

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
This isn't making any sense.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Miss Monotaka Mia?

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
That's right, and who are you?

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Yuri, the mysterious world of aesthetics and perversion.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The forbidden door opens right in front of Shido's very eyes.

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
It's alright. It will only scare you for a little while.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Face!

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
全ては必然

11
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,000
惹かれ合うような出会い

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
繋がるストーリーで

13
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,000
この胸の鼓動

14
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
理解できないなら

15
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,000
このまま落ちてゆくだけ

16
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,000
さあ選んで

17
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
鋭なデート

18
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
始めましょう

19
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
話すたび

20
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,000
触れるたび

21
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,000
笑うたび

22
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,000
目覚めてくこの想い

23
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,000
決して譲れないから

24
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,000
初めて

25
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,000
恋愛

26
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,000
素直に

27
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,000
こわり

28
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,000
いたいと思う

29
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,000
君に出会えたから

30
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
信じていろ

31
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,000
でたら

32
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,000
決して

33
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:21,000
喜ほど

34
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,000
I'm afraid losing is not an option.

35
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Thanks a lot, guys. Wait a second.

36
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Origami, you're performing too?

37
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Let's do it. I just need to know who plays what.

38
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,000
I can play a little guitar, I guess.

39
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,000
I can rock the bass.

40
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,000
I can play the drums!

41
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:40,000
No! The boom-booms are supposed to be mine!

42
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,000
Did she say boom-booms?

43
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,000
That is so lame.

44
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
Oh, that's right. You need to play the drums too.

45
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,000
I'm sorry, Toka, but Maya's pretty much an expert drummer.

46
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Don't worry. We'll find something for you to play.

47
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Cool?

48
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,000
Hmm.

49
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Wait a sec.

50
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,000
Do you even know how to play anything else?

51
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,000
I know.

52
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,000
Huh?

53
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Toka, this is like way huge.

54
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,000
What is it?

55
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,000
A legendary instrument that's super hard to play.

56
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,000
The key to any band's success.

57
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,000
That is so lame.

58
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Wow! That's incredible!

59
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,000
So, do you like it?

60
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Just you watch. I won't let you down.

61
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
Yeah!

62
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Now all we need is a lead singer.

63
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Awesome!

64
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Origami?

65
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Wow! That was totally amazing!

66
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:41,000
I didn't know you could sing like that, Origami!

67
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,000
That is so lame!

68
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,000
So you'll be singing.

69
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,000
It'll be my drop the mic moment.

70
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Oh!

71
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:58,000
I'm so exhausted after having to bust my hump dealing with that awful chick all day long.

72
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,000
I just can't keep it to myself anymore.

73
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:03,000
What a relief no one's around to hear me talking.

74
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:08,000
Tomorrow, September 23rd at precisely 1500 hours,

75
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,000
the third battle squad will charge into Tengu Square.

76
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,000
A difficult mission.

77
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Our primary goal is to capture Toka Yadogami, a girl thought to be a spirit.

78
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:21,000
And secondly, we aim to capture Shido Itsuka, second year student at Ryzen High School.

79
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:25,000
Oh boy, tomorrow's operation is incredibly annoying.

80
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:31,000
I'm so exhausted and unmotivated, I'm worried I might forget to lock the back door to hangar number two.

81
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Did you catch that?

82
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,000
Hope so.

83
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:45,000
So gentlemen, ladies and gentlemen, we will now have the 25th annual Joint High School Cultural Extravaganza,

84
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:48,000
the famous and beloved Tengu Festival!

85
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,000
Oh!

86
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:56,000
It's so frilly!

87
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:00,100
My, I gotta hand it to you, Shido.

88
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,440
You look surprisingly good in lady clothes.

89
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:04,820
Agreement. I would like to take you home with me.

90
00:05:05,340 --> 00:05:08,560
Oh, so, about this maid cafe?

91
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:12,020
That's gonna be fun. We gotta take down Rendouji, right?

92
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,740
With a beautiful but surprisingly innocent girl,

93
00:05:15,180 --> 00:05:18,740
a set of twins, and a tall yet timid and bashful type.

94
00:05:19,820 --> 00:05:22,220
Come on! The boys will love us!

95
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:25,360
Except for the ones who like older girls or are into other dudes.

96
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,820
That is so lame.

97
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:31,420
Wait. Origami. Does anyone know where she is?

98
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:33,600
Doubt. I have not seen her at all.

99
00:05:34,140 --> 00:05:36,440
Who knows? Maybe she slept straight through her alarm.

100
00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:40,560
Anyway, poster girl, you better get your game face on.

101
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:42,940
We're counting on you to bring in the customers.

102
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,440
Whoa.

103
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,740
Cool. This is gonna be so much fun.

104
00:05:49,940 --> 00:05:53,320
Stand by. We will follow your instructions and commands, Shiori.

105
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:55,780
Because, after all, you're our head maid.

106
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:56,200
Huh?

107
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,700
Your wish is our command!

108
00:06:00,780 --> 00:06:01,620
Wait. What?

109
00:06:02,220 --> 00:06:03,560
Well, I, uh...

110
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,680
I guess my command is that we all work hard.

111
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,700
Yes, ma'am!

112
00:06:07,140 --> 00:06:08,160
Step right up!

113
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,520
Don't be shy, boys.

114
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:19,220
I'm so stressed. I'm seeing things.

115
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:22,840
Miku.

116
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,600
Good morning, Shiori. How are you today?

117
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:28,600
From the looks of things, I'd say you're doing quite well.

118
00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:30,500
How nice of you to say.

119
00:06:30,500 --> 00:06:33,800
I've gotta admit, those clothes suit you.

120
00:06:34,300 --> 00:06:37,580
In fact, it might be interesting for you to wear that outfit every day.

121
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:40,140
Who knows? Over time, you might start to enjoy it.

122
00:06:40,260 --> 00:06:42,400
And then you can be my maidslave all the time.

123
00:06:42,620 --> 00:06:44,500
What? No way! You...

124
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:47,080
Wow, can't take a joke, huh?

125
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:49,640
Why don't we all go somewhere else?

126
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:56,980
Of course. That's Miku's power.

127
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,700
This is better, wouldn't you agree?

128
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:02,580
