194
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:43,920
She's missing out.

195
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,500
It's way more fun to be a plaything than to play with others.

196
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:51,400
And you should know I'm definitely going to beat you.

197
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:51,740
