It's not something you need to worry about.

201
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:01,680
But don't underestimate us.

202
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:06,880
If you think everything will always just go your way, then you're in for a big surprise.

203
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:07,620
Oh?

204
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:10,940
Then why don't we test it and find out?

205
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:14,740
I'd say our date is officially over now.

206
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:17,380
I'll be waiting for you on the stage.

207
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:21,100
Of course, that's assuming you're actually able to perform at all.

208
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:24,000
Attention all performers.

209
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:26,140
Please gather in the green room immediately.

210
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:30,600
