216
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:42,260
Feeling intimidated by my epic tambourine skills?

217
00:10:42,460 --> 00:10:44,800
Well, even if they don't come, we'll still jam.

218
00:10:44,900 --> 00:10:45,560
I know it.

219
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:47,640
