230
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:06,440
Shido.

231
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:08,360
What should we do?

232
00:11:08,760 --> 00:11:10,640
We can't perform with just the two of us.

233
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:11,920
You're right.

234
00:11:12,340 --> 00:11:14,520
