235
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:17,820
I can't cover all the instruments, but I'll send reinforcements.

236
00:11:18,020 --> 00:11:18,920
Is that going to fly?

237
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:20,180
It'll have to.

238
00:11:20,260 --> 00:11:21,580
We don't have any other choice.

239
00:11:22,020 --> 00:11:22,920
Yeah, true.

240
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,300
We'll make it work.

241
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,740
You're not giving me enough credit, Miku.

242
00:11:26,740 --> 00:11:28,480
And that's a huge mistake.

243
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,700
If this is the way you're going to play it,

244
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:33,000
then just wait, because I've got tricks of my own.

245
00:11:39,940 --> 00:11:40,860
Oh, wow.

246
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:56,400
We may have a situation here.

247
00:11:56,420 --> 00:11:56,920
Relax.

248
00:11:57,020 --> 00:11:58,760
I played with the facilities a little bit.

249
00:11:59,060 --> 00:11:59,840
Don't worry.

250
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:02,440
I'll turn the power back on once the crowd is chilled out.

251
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:03,280
Wow.

252
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:05,460
That's pretty hardcore even for you, Kotori.

253
00:12:08,300 --> 00:12:09,360
Shidaion Kai.

254
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:09,960
Sorry.

255
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:10,820
...

256
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:43,740
That's her spirit armor!

257
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:45,020
Inconceivable!

258
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:47,680
Hope you're ready for some fun!

259
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:50,120
Cause the real show's about to begin!

260
00:12:53,620 --> 00:12:56,440
When skies are turned from monochrome

261
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,420
To an excess of tomes

262
00:12:58,420 --> 00:13:01,120
The world is sure to begin

263
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:03,640
And if I have you by my side

264
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:05,540
Anytime, day or night

265
00:13:05,540 --> 00:13:08,540
Then I am sure to smile

266
00:13:08,540 --> 00:13:13,180
I can't stop loving you every day, whoa

267
00:13:13,180 --> 00:13:16,660
I can't stop loving you every day, whoa

268
00:13:16,660 --> 00:13:20,360
I can't stop loving you every day, whoa

269
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:23,000
I can't stop loving you

270
